{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026OusgxsK1Ho1794555534.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案，蔡天鳳前大伯鄺港傑繼續作供，稱事發後在龍尾村單位洗手間清洗染血器具，又稱扔垃圾時見到青紅蘿蔔和疑似豬骨的湯渣。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206124-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E7%A8%B1%E6%9B%BE%E6%B8%85%E6%B4%97%E6%9F%93%E8%A1%80%E5%99%A8%E5%85%B7%E6%89%94%E5%9E%83%E5%9C%BE%E7%9B%AE%E7%9D%B9%E9%9D%92%E7%B4%85%E8%98%BF%E8%94%94%E5%8F%8A%E7%96%91%E4%BC%BC%E8%B1%AC%E9%AA%A8%E6%B9%AF%E6%B8%A3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港傑稱曾清洗染血器具　扔垃圾目睹青紅蘿蔔及疑似豬骨湯渣</strong></a></p><p></p><p>瑪麗醫院新臨床大樓升降機事件，發展局的報告批評建築署監管不到位，有立法會議員提出，啟動部門首長責任制追究。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206121-%E7%91%AA%E9%BA%97%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E5%8D%87%E9%99%8D%E6%A9%9F%E4%BA%8B%E6%95%85%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E6%89%B9%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E7%BD%B2%E7%9B%A3%E7%AE%A1%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%9B%E6%9C%89%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E5%80%A1%E5%95%9F%E5%8B%95%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E9%A6%96%E9%95%B7%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB%E5%88%B6%E8%BF%BD%E7%A9%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>瑪麗醫院升降機事故｜報告批建築署監管不力　有議員倡啟動部門首長責任制追究</strong></a></p><p></p><p>微軟出現系統故障，影響電郵等服務，至少十多萬用戶報告受影響，包括港交所。本港不少商業機構都受影響，電郵Outlook帳戶凌晨起一直未能開啟。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206111-%E6%9C%AC%E6%B8%AF%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E5%95%86%E6%A5%AD%E6%A9%9F%E6%A7%8B%E5%8F%97%E5%BE%AE%E8%BB%9F%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E6%B3%A2%E5%8F%8A%E5%87%8C%E6%99%A8%E8%B5%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%9B%B4%E6%9C%AA%E8%83%BD%E9%96%8B%E5%95%9FOutlook%E5%B8%B3%E6%88%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>本港不少商業機構受微軟系統故障波及　凌晨起一直未能開啟Outlook帳戶</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府提出立法加強醫療藥械的法定審批、註冊和監管機制，立法會一個委員會上，醫務衞生局局長盧寵茂表示，市民網購或從境外帶藥械回港，是否違法視乎數量。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1206140-%E7%9B%A7%E5%AF%B5%E8%8C%82%E6%8C%87%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E7%B6%B2%E8%B3%BC%E6%88%96%E5%BE%9E%E5%A2%83%E5%A4%96%E5%B8%B6%E8%97%A5%E6%A2%B0%E5%9B%9E%E6%B8%AF%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E9%81%95%E6%B3%95%E8%A6%96%E4%B9%8E%E6%95%B8%E9%87%8F%E5%8F%8A%E7%9B%AE%E7%9A%84\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>盧寵茂指市民網購或從境外帶藥械回港　是否違法視乎數量及目的</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T08:38:32.650302+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:19.729652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T08:31:51.125348+00:00","content_hash":"566df8195a84790e4985186c48c11aacef9e5aa043c9b032e926dea1b99dc14f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}